      "title": "pmndrs logo",
      "description": "The pmndrs logo as SVG — complete, idle, animated and loading — into `public/pmndrs/`, so `/pmndrs/logo_loading.svg` is a plain image URL. The animations are CSS inside the files, with a reduced-motion fallback.",
      "author": "pmndrs",
